      "id": "survey-akari-acua",
      "subject": "AKARI AcuA",
      "status": "included",
      "finding": "[AKARI AcuA](https://data.darts.isas.jaxa.jp/pub/akari/AKARI-IRC_Catalogue_AllSky_AcuA_1.0/) — included as an explicitly approximate thermal size transfer. Its fitted nonrotating-sphere diameter is 85.34 ± 2.86 km. Formal catalog error omits additional shape, spin and thermal-model effects; no total confidence interval is invented. The original catalogue row for asteroid 162 was retrieved again and matched field-for-field with the retained row, including diameter, reported error and detection count.",
